Diode reverse breakdown with recombination, area and sidewall scaling
* Provenance: original R4 verification circuit.
Vbias in 0 DC 0.6 AC 1
Rs in d 50
D1 d 0 junction area=2 pj=10u
.model junction d(is=1e-14 n=1 bv=3 ibv=1m nbv=1.2 tbv1=0.0007 tbv2=1u
+ isr=5p nr=1.8
+ ikf=1m jsw=1e-10 cjp=1u php=0.8 mjsw=0.3 cjo=1p)
.dc Vbias -3.1 1.0 0.05
.end
